OL,3,GNEWSATown's historic market cross
OL,4,Aflattened in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic town centre market cross has
OL,7,Fbeen demolished after a 4x4 car crashed
OL,8,Finto it.
OL,10,FEmergency services went to the scene of
OL,11,Fthe incident involving a car and a
OL,12,Fpedestrian in Howden's Market Place,
OL,13,FHumberside Police said.
OL,15,FPictures from the scene show a silver
OL,16,FRange Rover straddled across the
OL,17,Fstructure's base, which dates back to
OL,18,Fmedieval times, with sections of the
OL,19,Fcross strewn across the ground.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
