OL,3,GNEWSATown's historic market cross
OL,4,Aflattened in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson said there were
OL,7,Fno reports of any serious injuries as a
OL,8,Fresult of the incident, which happened
OL,9,Fat about 10:40 BST, and the vehicle had
OL,10,Fsince been recovered.
